//! Lower memory ops: Load, Store.
//!
//! `Load { addr, ty }`: dereference `addr` (a 16-bit pointer in a
//! slot) and store the loaded word into the result slot.
//! `Store { addr, val }`: load `val` into ACC, then store ACC into
